  "content": "<p data-pid=\"gKghF3FF\">……紧接着是两个对特定学术争论进行更深入探讨的系列：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Physicalism201Sequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​「物理主义导论」</a>（关于意识的困难问题）和<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/QuantumPhysicsAndManyWorldsSequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​「量子物理与多世界」</a>（关于物理学中的测量问题）。</p><p data-pid=\"B1s4KdJ8\">—Rob Bensinger，<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/TheWorldAnIntroduction\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​《世界：导读》</a><sup data-text=\"世界：导读\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2064705136883245583\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup></p><hr/><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2094433739879224610\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"量子解释\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ec8f87e275528a7c8baccb8cc6b54b01.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">量子解释</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2094830441081599393\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"构型与振幅\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-59f53238eed414950b3bad13427e3d70.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">构型与振幅</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2095226693917086175\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"联合构型\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-44fbafb5e5a05a6f20e7742e62da35e8.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">联合构型</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2095629973038044075\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"不同的构型\" data